mbed fairness, transparency, and responsible selling throughout the organisation. Oversee product compliance, marketing reviews, pricing governance, and distribution oversight. Implement complaint handling frameworks aligned with regulatory standards. Cross-Functional Support & Training Partner with product, operations, legal, marketing, and commercial teams to ensure compliant execution. Provide guidance on regulatory implications of new products, partnerships, or distribution models. Deliver training to ensure teams understand and execute compliance responsibilities. You Will Thrive in This Role If You See compliance as a strategic enabler, not a blocker. Operate with high integrity, sound judgment, and strong attention to detail. Communicate clearly and influence leaders using data and logic. Enjoy building frameworks and scaling systems from early-stage to mature environments. Thrive in fast-paced, evolving settings where regulation meets innovation. What You Bring 8+ years of compliance, risk, or regulatory experience within financial services, insurance, insurtech, or fintech. Deep understanding of UK regulatory frameworks, including FCA rules and consumer duty requirements. Experience in compliance for digital platforms, distribution, or insurance products (preferred). Proven ability to design policies, conduct risk assessments, and manage complex compliance programs. Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, including dealing with regulators. Bonus (Nice to Have) Experience in start-up or high-growth environments. Previous SMF experience. Background in insurtech, digital distribution, or online marketplaces. Knowledge of GDPR, AML, sanctions, or cross-border compliance. Location Requirement This role is based in the UK. This is a hybrid role. You are expected to work from our London office at least 3 days per week. Why Join Us Shape compliance for a fast-growing international fintech-insurtech platform. Build frameworks that enable safe, inclusive financial access at scale. Work closely with leadership and regulators to drive responsible innovation. Competitive compensation with long-term growth and international career opportunities. Compensations Range We offer a highly competitive package, ranging from £100,000 to £150,000, reflecting both experience and suitability for this pivotal role. Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
