    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>About The Company</strong></p> <p>GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe's strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.</p></div><div class=\"job\"> <h2><strong>About the Role:</strong></h2> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">This role&nbsp;sits in the Product team of&nbsp;our&nbsp;Digital Building System &amp; Planning&nbsp;(DBSP)&nbsp;vertical, whose function is to provide the&nbsp;essential&nbsp;link&nbsp;in our digital value chain&nbsp;between our physical building&nbsp;planning teams and our&nbsp;product delivery&nbsp;and execution&nbsp;teams, who&nbsp;coordinate&nbsp;the automated production and site assembly of our projects.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">As a Product Manager on this team, you will&nbsp;help drive the development of the&nbsp;key&nbsp;digital products which&nbsp;define our building system and enable its&nbsp;scalable&nbsp;application to our growing number of building projects.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h2><strong>What you'll be doing:</strong></h2> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Manage and coordinate&nbsp;the development of the GROPYUS&nbsp;digital&nbsp;products that&nbsp;enable&nbsp;fast and efficient&nbsp;building&nbsp;product design and project&nbsp;planning across&nbsp;the digital value chain</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Align regularly with our stakeholders&nbsp;across&nbsp;different departments and&nbsp;teams&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate current and future user needs into product requirements</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Help manage&nbsp;our vertical’s&nbsp;roadmap,&nbsp;together with your product management colleagues and&nbsp;in alignment with the DBSP&nbsp;Heads,&nbsp;our&nbsp;Tech Leads,&nbsp;and their teams&nbsp;of software engineers,&nbsp;to ensure&nbsp;efficient&nbsp;utilization&nbsp;of resources and&nbsp;a delivery plan in line with our quarterly goals</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Apply&nbsp;product lifecycle management principles to the development of&nbsp;our&nbsp;products,&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;steady improvement of the evolving product&nbsp;in terms of cost, quality, and efficiency,&nbsp;while&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;data consistency across versions</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 5\">You will work closely with:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:200}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">The&nbsp;DBSP Tech&nbsp;software engineering team;&nbsp;one of the Tech&nbsp;Leads&nbsp;will be your working pair from the Technology Business Unit</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our embedded designer from the Product Design&nbsp;team, who contributes&nbsp;their&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;user&nbsp;experience&nbsp;and the various&nbsp;user&nbsp;interfaces&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;products</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Building System Team, who together with Building Product&nbsp;and Building Technical Infrastructure (BTI), defines&nbsp;the architectural and engineering design of our building system</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Product Delivery Team, with whom we&nbsp;interface for&nbsp;the production and assembly of our building projects</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Solutions Team, who implements&nbsp;our building&nbsp;system product in our live building projects</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h2><strong>What you bring:</strong></h2> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are a&nbsp;product manager&nbsp;with at least&nbsp;3+&nbsp;years of experience, ideally with&nbsp;a BSc or MSc;&nbsp;experience with tech products in the&nbsp;architecture, engineering, or construction&nbsp;sectors&nbsp;a plus</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You have experience managing the development of innovative, specialized&nbsp;digital&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;either for internal or external&nbsp;applications;&nbsp;familiarity&nbsp;with architectural or engineering planning&nbsp;software&nbsp;is a plus</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You enjoy problem solving and excel at finding&nbsp;user-centric&nbsp;solutions to complex problems with many moving parts&nbsp;and multiple stakeholders</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are comfortable&nbsp;and confident in&nbsp;setting high-level goals aligned with an overall strategy, and&nbsp;breaking these down into features&nbsp;and deliverables in the form of quarterly goals and epic-level roadmaps&nbsp;for your team</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"30\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are a skilled communicator and excel at&nbsp;stakeholder&nbsp;management&nbsp;and user communication,&nbsp;able to&nbsp;interpret their needs and goals in a way that can be translated into product features and functions</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">You&nbsp;</span><span data-contrast=\"none\">have a proven&nbsp;ability to&nbsp;operate&nbsp;as a Product Manager within&nbsp;a Product/Tech vertical organizational structure,&nbsp;collaborating closely with cross-functional engineering, design, and delivery&nbsp;teams</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>What We Offer</strong></span></h2> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">An&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">unlimited&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">contract with 30 vacation days. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Flexible, hybrid work:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;You can work from home or come into the office on the schedule that works best for you.&nbsp;Feel&nbsp;like traveling&nbsp;and working from another location? No problem. Tune into meetings and work from abroad for up to 40 days per year. In addition, flex hours allow you to prioritize important moments in your day.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Attractive&nbsp;perks&nbsp;and benefits</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: We offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;company pension scheme, language courses (English/German),&nbsp;and employee discounts with&nbsp;selected&nbsp;sustainable brands. Furthermore, our external partners in mental health support you in strengthening your mental health through anonymous private/group sessions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Virtual&nbsp;Shares&nbsp;Program</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">:&nbsp;Participate&nbsp;in the success of GROPYUS through our Virtual Share Program.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ownership</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: You&nbsp;can truly make your mark with your work and contributions&nbsp;–&nbsp;on</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;all&nbsp;our organizational&nbsp;levels. Find your solutions,&nbsp;drive&nbsp;and test them.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The chance to be part of something big</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">:&nbsp;Our&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;rethink&nbsp;an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and fostering sustainable, affordable living.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A diverse and enriching work environment</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">:&nbsp;Become a&nbsp;valued&nbsp;member&nbsp;of a wonderfully diverse team of individuals from over 50 countries.&nbsp;At GROPYUS we value inclusion&nbsp;above all, ensuring&nbsp;that everyone feels&nbsp;they belong&nbsp;– no matter their background. In this way, our differences become strengths that help us grow as a team.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> </div><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h4>Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.<br><br>We can't wait to get to know you.&nbsp;<br>For more information, visit our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gropyus.com/\">website</a>.</h4></div> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
