    schema:description "Director Sales DACH (f/m/d) New Business | B2B SaaS | E-Commerce | Revenue Leadership | Cologne | Hybrid | Permanent Shape the next stage of our Sales organization. At Trusted Shops, we build digital trust between people, businesses, and AI agents. Every day, millions of consumers rely on our solutions to make confident purchasing decisions, while thousands of businesses strengthen customer relationships and drive sustainable growth. As Director Sales DACH – New Business, you will take ownership of an established New Business Sales organization in our largest market and lead it through the next phase of its sales transformation. Together with your leadership team, you will build a modern AI-first sales organization, introduce AI-driven automation, and establish a scalable sales engine with a clear go-to-market strategy, outstanding sales excellence, and sustainable revenue growth. You combine strategic thinking with operational leadership and foster a high-performance culture focused on customer value, business impact, and long-term success. Your Responsibilities Lead our Sales Transformation: Develop our established New Business Sales organization in the DACH market into a scalable, customer-centric, AI-powered sales engine. Lead change with clarity, consistency, and empathy. Drive Revenue Growth & ARR: Together with five Team Leads, manage our Core segment (€2,000–€50,000 ARR), own revenue and growth targets, and build a data-driven revenue organization with accurate forecasting, clear KPIs, and disciplined pipeline management. Stay Close to the Business: Lead deal reviews, pipeline reviews, and forecast reviews while personally supporting strategic opportunities. Ensure outstanding CRM data quality and transparency across the organization. Implement AI Automation: Introduce AI-powered workflows and modern sales technologies across prospecting, sequencing, call intelligence, forecasting, and other key areas to improve productivity, conversion rates, and deal quality. Scale Sales Excellence: Embed methodologies such as Value Selling, BANT, and Reference Selling into standardized playbooks and repeatable best practices. Develop your leaders and teams in discovery, business case development, stakeholder management, and closing. Put Customer Value First: Partner with Marketing, Product, Customer Success, Account Management, and Partner Management to continuously evolve our go-to-market strategy, create a seamless customer journey, and drive sustainable revenue growth in e-commerce. Proven Sales Transformation Experience: You have successfully transformed larger B2B SaaS or software sales organizations, driving improvements across strategy, organizational design, processes, leadership, and commercial performance. Extensive Sales Leadership Experience: You have at least five years of experience leading larger New Business, Commercial, or Revenue organizations and have a strong track record of developing leaders and high-performing teams. Operational Leadership: You enjoy staying close to the business, actively supporting complex sales cycles while coaching your teams through hands-on leadership, deal coaching, and high quality standards. AI Automation Expertise: You have successfully introduced automation and AI-powered sales tools into commercial organizations and know how to integrate new technologies into existing sales processes while driving adoption across teams. Commercial Excellence: Forecasting, KPI-driven sales management, CRM excellence, pipeline management, predictable revenue, go-to-market strategy, and cross-functional stakeholder management are among your core strengths. International Collaboration: You are fluent in German and English and thrive in an international B2B SaaS and e-commerce environment. Why Trusted Shops? At Trusted Shops, you'll help shape not only the future of our Sales organization but also the future of digital trust. You'll join an environment that offers real ownership, short decision-making paths, and a strong leadership team committed to innovation, collaboration, and sustainable growth. If you've successfully led sales transformations, enjoy staying close to the business, and see AI as a key driver of scalable commercial success, we'd love to meet you. What We Offer Permanent contract with Europe's trusted brand. 28 vacation days + 2.5 additional days off at Christmas, New Year's Eve and Carnival. Buddy program: An experienced trustee is at your side. Learning & Development: Individual training opportunities. Events: Team Events, Unit Events, etc. Health Pass: Earn an additional vacation day by actively participating in free online and offline sports, fitness and health courses. BUILD A COMMUNITY OF TRUST WITH US - #cometotrust Du bist Dir nicht sicher, ob Du bist, wonach wir hier suchen? Bewirb Dich! ​ Bei Trusted Shops interessieren wir uns für Dich als Mensch - ob Du zu uns passt, ist unabhängig von Geschlecht, Nationalität, ethnischer und sozialer Herkunft, Religion/Weltanschauung, Behinderung, Alter sowie sexueller Orientierung und Identität. Trusted Shops bekennt sich klar zu Diversität und gegen Diskriminierung. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
