    schema:datePosted "2026-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><img src=\"https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p></div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">RELEX Solutions is looking for talents, innovators and people who really want to get stuck in and make a difference. People like you! RELEX Solutions is a leading international software company with Finnish roots. Our cloud-based platform optimizes retail and supply chain processes across all industries - from DIY, pharmaceuticals and FMCG to manufacturing and our specialty (food) retail.</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">And as an employer? At RELEX, not only the optimization of trade is our top priority, but also our employees. You benefit from a high degree of autonomy, flat hierarchies, diverse development opportunities and a working environment in which we pay particular attention to the compatibility of professional and private life.</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">We are looking for a<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong>Senior Solution Consultant (m/f/*)</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong>CPG / Manufacturing</strong> to join our team. We're looking for an experienced professional with a passion for using the latest technologies – including machine learning – to optimize our customers' supply chains and mentor the next generation of consultants.</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">You'll be joining a highly skilled team of consultants, taking a leading role in shaping solutions, driving best practices, and contributing to the growth of the team. You'll work closely with both our customers and in-house teams to deliver innovative, creative solutions at scale. The role requires deep expertise in supply chain business processes and software configuration.</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">&nbsp;</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What you'll be doing:</strong></p> <ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\"> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Lead customer engagements to define business objectives and translate them into strategic planning solutions.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Drive cross-functional collaboration to architect and deliver tailored supply chain solutions that measurably improve customer profitability.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Own the end-to-end integration of our product with clients' existing systems and processes, ensuring scalability and long-term fit.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Oversee rigorous testing and quality assurance to ensure solutions meet the highest standards.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Act as a trusted advisor, guiding customers in maximizing the value of our product and championing continuous improvement.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Provide senior-level support for critical incidents and lead value-driven development initiatives.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Mentor and coach junior consultants, sharing expertise and raising the overall capability of the team.</li> </ul> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">&nbsp;</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What you will bring to the table:</strong></p> <ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\"> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">A relevant academic background (e.g., Business, Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Computer Science, Data Analytics, or related fields).</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Extensive professional experience in solution design, consulting, supply chain operations, or software implementation, ideally within SaaS or ERP/Planning systems.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Deep expertise in manufacturing operations with a comprehensive understanding of planning and scheduling challenges at scale.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Advanced data analytics, critical thinking, and problem-solving skills; strong proficiency with SQL.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">A strong track record of leading complex implementations, including testing, quality assurance, training, and user adoption.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with demonstrated ability to influence at all levels of an organization.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">A proactive, adaptable mindset with proven ability to manage multiple priorities and lead in a fast-changing environment.</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Fluency in English and German is required.</li> </ul> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">&nbsp;</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What we offer in return</strong></p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">You'll be supported and given the space to thrive. We offer meaningful work, flexibility, and a culture that backs you to share your voice and be authentic.</p> <ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\"> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">An international career and learning opportunities</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">A rapidly growing and financially robust software company with exciting opportunities for career growth, also in the future</li> </ul> <p>These are the RELEX key benefits</p> <ul> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Flexible working</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Genuine work-life balance</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Annual leave</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Internet and mobile phone benefits</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Diverse, inclusive, and supportive work culture</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Meaningful work with a commitment to a more sustainable future</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">High autonomy</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Room for creativity</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Strong team spirit through company parties, two team days per year, and after-work activities</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Family-oriented policies</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Flat hierarchies</li> <li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Two paid volunteering days each year</li> </ul> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">&nbsp;</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Interested? Please apply with your full application documents, salary expectations, and earliest possible start date using the button below.</p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>We value diversity and welcome applications from all backgrounds—regardless of gender, nationality, ethnicity, social background, religion, disability, age, sexual orientation, or identity.</strong></p> <p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">To learn more about RELEX, visit relexsolutions.com. For questions about the application process, feel free to contact us at<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" ---------- class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><img src=\"https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p></div> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
