    schema:description "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">SLSQ427R400</p> <p class=\"p1\">As we continue our rapid expansion, we are seeking a dynamic, results-oriented Strategic Hunter Account Executive to join our team in France.</p> <p class=\"p1\">In this pivotal role, you will take ownership of some of France’s leading&nbsp;accounts. This is a&nbsp;high-visibility opportunity to deepen relationships, explore new business avenues, and deliver</p> <p class=\"p1\">transformative outcomes within the accounts.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Reporting to our Director of Enterprise Sales, as a Strategic Hunter Account Executive at&nbsp;Databricks, you will focus on identifying, engaging, and securing new opportunities within the&nbsp;accounts.</p> <p class=\"p1\">You are a true hunter — establishing executive-level connections, uncovering&nbsp;untapped potential, and positioning Databricks as the premier platform for data, analytics, and&nbsp;AI innovation.</p> <p class=\"p1\">You will be leveraging your extensive hunting expertise, along with your solutions sales&nbsp;experience in selling technical solutions in data/AI, advanced Analytics to inspire the client’s&nbsp;vision and help shape how they leverage these technologies to drive business outcomes. Your&nbsp;success will be measured by your ability to generate demand, close high-value deals, and&nbsp;expand Databricks’ footprint within the accounts.</p> <p class=\"p1\"><strong>The impact you'll have:</strong></p> <p class=\"p1\">Leverage your expertise to identify new opportunities and&nbsp;create use cases that demonstrate Databricks’ value and impact.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Use your commercial network and strong relationship skills to broaden our presence&nbsp;within complex organizations—engaging key decision-makers and trusted partners to drive growth.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Develop structured account plans that address your client’s business priorities and&nbsp;position Databricks as a long-term digital transformation partner.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Draw on your experience selling cloud-based solutions to navigate enterprise cycles,&nbsp;secure executive sponsorship, and deliver beyond customer expectations.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Work closely with Databricks teams and selected partners to deliver tailored solutions that&nbsp;meet the specific needs of the customers.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Apply your sales expertise to close sophisticated business and drive clear, measurable results within the accounts.</p> <p class=\"p1\">&nbsp;</p> <p class=\"p1\"><strong>What we look for:</strong></p> <p class=\"p1\">Demonstrated passion and experience in selling complex, technical cloud solutions, with&nbsp;the drive to understand and translate advanced technology into business outcomes.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Extensive Hunting experience and understanding of the complexities and nuances of strategic accounts. A track record of selling into Large Enterprise accounts is&nbsp;essential.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Proven hands-on experience working with open source technologies, and a strong&nbsp;background in advising on build-versus-buy decisions for enterprise clients.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Proven track record in selling big data, AI/Analytics solutions, with&nbsp;expertise navigating multi-stakeholder enterprise environments.</p> <p class=\"p1\">An understanding of, or experienced in selling consumption model solutions is highly&nbsp;desirable.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Experience of applying value-based selling methodologies, consistently positioning</p> <p class=\"p1\">technology solutions around measurable customer impact and ROI.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Creative, resourceful sales professional with a structured and proactive prospecting&nbsp;motion—capable of building a sustainable pipeline from scratch.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Consistently exceeded sales quotas, showing a results-driven approach and commitment&nbsp;to surpassing ambitious targets.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Grit, resilience, and tenacity—excited by the challenge of opening greenfield accounts,&nbsp;building new relationships, and driving growth in untapped territories.</p> <p class=\"p1\">Fluency in French and English is essential.</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>About Databricks</strong></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks\">LinkedIn</a>, <a href=\"https://x.com/databricks\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en\">Instagram</a>.<br><br><strong>Benefits<br><br></strong></span>At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing\">here</a>.<br><br></p> <p><strong>Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion</strong></p> <p>At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.</p> <p><strong>Compliance</strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer's discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.</span></strong></p></div> Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
